2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Negative\040Matter\040as\040Unified\040Dark\040Matter\040and\040Dark\040Energy\072\040Simplest\040Model\054\040Theory\040and\040Nine\040Tests\072\040Dark\040Matter\040and\040Dark\040Energy)
/Author (Yi\055Fang\040Chang)
/Subject (Based\040on\040Dirac\220s\040negative\040energy\054\040we\040propose\040and\040study\040the\040negative\040matter\056\040Bondi\220s\040results\040are\040wrong\056\040First\054\040the\040negative\040matter\040can\040be\040the\040simplest\040model\040of\040unified\040dark\040matter\040and\040dark\040energy\056\040Next\054\040we\040discuss\040various\040possible\040theories\040of\040the\040negative\040matter\072\040some\040field\040equations\054\040similar\040electrodynamics\054\040field\040equations\040with\040non\055symmetry\054\040etc\056\040Third\054\040the\040quantum\040theory\040of\040negative\040matter\040is\040researched\056\040Matter\040surrounded\040by\040dark\055negative\040matter\040corresponds\040to\040an\040infinitely\040deep\040potential\040trap\040in\040quantum\040mechanics\040and\040forms\040a\040base\040of\040the\040universal\040wave\055particle\040duality\040and\040quantum\040mechanics\056\040Fourth\054\040we\040propose\040the\040mechanism\040of\040inflation\040as\040the\040origin\040of\040positive\055negative\040matters\040created\040from\040nothing\056\040Fifth\054\040assume\040that\040dark\040matter\040is\040completely\040the\040negative\040matter\054\040and\040we\040may\040calculate\040an\040evolutional\040ratio\040between\040total\040matter\040and\040usual\040matter\040from\0401\040of\040inflation\040and\040the\040radiation\055dominated\040universe\040to\0407\05688\040of\040the\040present\040matter\055dominated\040universe\056\040It\040agrees\040with\040the\040observed\040value\0406\05636\1767\056\040Sixth\054\040we\040research\040the\040relativity\040of\040the\040negative\040matter\040and\040theory\040in\040Lobachevskian\040geometry\056\040Seventh\054\040we\040propose\040a\040judgment\040test\040of\040the\040negative\040matter\040as\040dark\040matter\040is\040opposite\040repulsive\040lensing\040and\040other\040eight\040possible\040tests\056\040Eighty\054\040we\040propose\040a\040figure\040on\040the\040unification\040of\040the\040four\040basic\040interactions\040in\040three\055dimensional\040space\054\040in\040which\040the\040\215running\216\040coupling\040constants\040of\040strong\040and\040weak\040interactions\040transform\040each\040other\056\040The\040negative\040matter\040as\040a\040candidate\040of\040unification\040of\040dark\040matter\040and\040dark\040energy\040is\040not\040only\040the\040simplest\054\040and\040may\040explain\040inflation\040and\040be\040calculated\040and\040tested\056)
/Keywords (19\040Dec\0402020\054\040Negative\040mass\054\040Dark\040matter\054\040Dark\040energy\054\040Universe\054\040Negative\040energy\054\040Yunnan\040University)
